    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "Welcome Aboard!\nPiedmont's transcontinental\nservice is the culmination of five years of\nunparalleled growth. In a period of sixty months, Piedmont has taken delivery\nof two additional aircraft every three months and added a new destination\nevery other month.\nThis growth has been founded on standards of service that stress excellence\nand quality. Our transcontinental service gives us a new opportunity to\ndemonstrate just what Piedmont can do. On behalf of the 13,000 men and\nwomen of Piedmont, I want you to know we take a special pride in having\nyou fly with us today.\nSincerely.\nWilkie. Homond\nWilliam R. Howard\nPresident and\nChief Executive Officer\nFor Your Enjoyment\nFresh Tropical Fruits\nSmoked Cheese OmelettE\nA Huffy Omelette Filled with Smoked Gruyere Cheese\nAccompanied by Potato Pancakes and a Petite Filet Mignon\nChEEsE BlintzEs\nDelicate Blintzes Filled with Cottage Cheese Seasoned\nwith a Hint of Cinnamon and Orange Accompanied by\nTennessee Sausage Patties and South Carolina Sausage Links\nBlenheim Apricot Preserves\nFresh Croissants\nCascade Mountain Strawberry PrEsErvEs\nCreamery\nButter\nPrior to Arrival\nAn Assortment of Cheese and Fresh Fruit\nId Salem Moravian Ginger and Sugar Cookie\n(A North Carolina Specialty/"
